+   A QR modal appears. Scan it with your phone and enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app (or type the code in the modal).
+   First, link your app: **My account → Set up authenticator** (see below). Until you do, the seeded `admin`/`analyst` accounts accept the dev reference `demo-fingerprint`.
    The incident becomes **Contained**, the endpoint **Isolated**, and the action is audited. Reusing the verification fails.
